.TH ALETHEIA_CLI 1 "2026-11-24" "Aletheia 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aletheia_cli \- remove image backgrounds in batch
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aletheia_cli
.RB [ \-o
.IR output_directory ]
.RB [ \-m
.IR model.onnx ]
.RB [ \-f
.IR format ]
.RB [ \-j
.IR jobs ]
.I input_directory
.RI [ output_directory ]
.RI [ model.onnx ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aletheia_cli
loads an ONNX background-removal model and processes every supported
image in
.IR input_directory .
Results are written with the suffix
.B _rembg
and never overwrite existing files.
.PP
The model is loaded once and reused for the whole batch. Processing is
done locally; no image data leaves the machine.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I input_directory
Directory containing the images to process.
.TP
.I output_directory
Directory for the results. Defaults to
.B _rembg_output
in the current directory.
.TP
.I model.onnx
Path to an ONNX model. If omitted, the program searches for
.B u2netp.onnx
next to the executable, in the installation directory, in the models
directory and in the current directory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show usage information and exit.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-o ", " \-\-output " " directory
Write the results to
.IR directory .
Equivalent to the second positional argument.
.TP
.BI \-m ", " \-\-model " " model.onnx
Use
.IR model.onnx
instead of the default model. Equivalent to the third positional
argument.
.TP
.BI \-f ", " \-\-format " " format
Set output format (png, jpg, webp). Defaults to png. The file
extension follows the chosen format.
.TP
.BI \-j ", " \-\-jobs " " N
Process
.I N
images in parallel (1 = sequential, the default). Useful with small
models on multi-core machines.
.TP
.B \-\-quality " " N
JPEG/WebP quality (1-100). Defaults to 90.
.TP
.B \-\-png-compression " " N
PNG compression level (0-9; 0 means no compression). Defaults to 6.
.TP
.B \-\-threshold " " N
Alpha threshold (0-255). Pixels with alpha below this value become
fully transparent. Defaults to 30.
.TP
.B \-\-clean-noise
Make pixels below the alpha threshold transparent.
.TP
.B \-\-refine-intensity " " N
Edge refinement intensity (0-100). Defaults to 50.
.TP
.B \-\-sticker
Add a sticker outline around the cutout.
.TP
.B \-\-sticker-width " " N
Sticker outline width (1-50 px). Defaults to 6.
.TP
.B \-\-sticker-color " " color
Sticker outline color (#RRGGBB). Defaults to #ffffff.
.TP
.B \-\-shadow
Add a drop shadow.
.TP
.B \-\-shadow-blur " " N
Shadow blur (0-80 px). Defaults to 10.
.TP
.B \-\-shadow-offset-x " " N
Horizontal shadow offset (-100 to 100). Defaults to 4.
.TP
.B \-\-shadow-offset-y " " N
Vertical shadow offset (-100 to 100). Defaults to 6.
.TP
.B \-\-shadow-opacity " " N
Shadow opacity (0-100). Defaults to 50.
.TP
.B \-\-background " " color
Solid output background (#RRGGBB).
.TP
.B \-\-resize " " size
Final size: WIDTH or WIDTHxHEIGHT.
.TP
.B \-\-rotate " " N
Final rotation (0, 90, 180 or 270 degrees). Defaults to 0.
.TP
.B \-\-crop " " spec
Normalized crop: x,y,width,height (all between 0 and 1).
.TP
.B \-\-chroma-key " " color
Color removal instead of AI (#RRGGBB).
.TP
.B \-\-chroma-tolerance " " N
Chroma key tolerance (0-100). Defaults to 0.
.TP
.B \-\-chroma-contiguous
Remove only background connected to the borders.
.TP
.B \-\-chroma-soft-edges
Disable hard Pixel Art edges.
.TP
.B \-\-despill " " N
Chroma key despill (0-100). Defaults to 0.
.TP
.B \-\-feather " " N
Mask feather radius (0-5 px). Defaults to 0.
.TP
.B \-\-no-metadata
Do not copy EXIF, GPS or other text metadata from the source.
.SH EXAMPLES
Process a folder with the default model:
.PP
.nf
.RS
aletheia_cli ~/Pictures/input ~/Pictures/output
.RE
.fi
.PP
Process a single image:
.PP
.nf
.RS
aletheia_cli photo.png -o photo_rembg.png
.RE
.fi
.PP
Use long options:
.PP
.nf
.RS
aletheia_cli ~/Pictures/input --output ~/Pictures/output --model u2net.onnx --format webp
.RE
.fi
.PP
Process four images in parallel:
.PP
.nf
.RS
aletheia_cli ~/Pictures/input --output ~/Pictures/output --jobs 4
.RE
.fi
.PP
Use chroma key with despill:
.PP
.nf
.RS
aletheia_cli sprite.png --chroma-key '#00ff00' --despill 80 --feather 1
.RE
.fi
.PP
Resize and rotate:
.PP
.nf
.RS
aletheia_cli photo.png -o out.png --resize 1000x1000 --rotate 90
.RE
.fi
.PP
Use a specific model:
.PP
.nf
.RS
aletheia_cli ~/Pictures/input ~/Pictures/output u2net.onnx
.RE
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 when every image was processed successfully. Returns 1 when
the input/output directory is invalid, the model cannot be loaded, or at
least one image fails. Returns 130 when interrupted by Ctrl+C (SIGINT/SIGTERM).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ALETHEIA_LANG
Interface language: pt, en or es (default: system locale).
.TP
.B ALETHEIA_PROVIDER
ONNX execution provider: auto, cpu, cuda, dml or coreml (default: auto).
.TP
.B ALETHEIA_NO_UPDATE_CHECK
If set, disables the update check (GUI only).
.SH SEE ALSO
Project page: https://github.com/MarielCarlosFrias/aletheia
